{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/5058","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/5058/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/5058/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/5058/events","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/5058","id":128415922,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjg0MTU5MjI=","number":5058,"title":"Bug in no-extra-bind","user":{"login":"mjomble","id":2202751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDI3NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2202751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble","html_url":"https://github.com/mjomble","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjomble/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":45711350,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTcxMTM1MA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":"ESLint is working incorrectly"},{"id":45798639,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTc5ODYzOQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/rule","name":"rule","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Relates to ESLint's core rules"},{"id":131106229,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzExMDYyMjk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/accepted","name":"accepted","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":"There is consensus among the team that this change meets the criteria for inclusion"},{"id":829215248,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MjkyMTUyNDg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/archived%20due%20to%20age","name":"archived due to age","color":"eeeeee","default":false,"description":"This issue has been archived; please open a new issue for any further discussion"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2016-01-24T18:32:45Z","updated_at":"2018-02-06T23:36:25Z","closed_at":"2016-01-25T16:27:02Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I found another bug in this rule.\n\nIf the `this` keyword only appears as the parameter to `bind`, it doesn't get registered in the right scope because we've already exited the `FunctionExpression`, but not yet from its associated `CallExpression`.\n\nSo in code like this:\n\n``` javascript\nvar a = function() {\n  (function() {\n    this.b\n  }.bind(this))\n}.bind(c)\n```\n\nthe outer `bind(c)` is marked as unnecessary, even though `this` is actually used in the bound function.\n\nThe bug gets fixed (and other tests will also pass) if I replace this:\n\n``` javascript\nif (top.depth === 0) {\n    top.found++;\n}\n```\n\nwith this:\n\n``` javascript\nif (top.depth === 0) {\n    top.found++;\n} else if (top.depth === -1 && scope.length > 1) {\n    var parentOfTop = scope[scope.length - 2];\n    parentOfTop.found++;\n}\n```\n\nIt feels slightly hacky, but I'm not sure how to solve it in a cleaner way.\n\nI can submit a PR with this fix if needed.\n","closed_by":{"login":"nzakas","id":38546,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38546?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas","html_url":"https://github.com/nzakas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nzakas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/5058/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/5058/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}